VVEERRSSIIOONNSS
       You probably want to use the iioo__ddeessttrrooyy() wrapper function provided  by
       _l_i_b_a_i_o.

       Note  that  the  _l_i_b_a_i_o wrapper function uses a different type (_i_o___c_o_n_‐
       _t_e_x_t___t) for the _c_t_x___i_d argument.  Note also  that  the  _l_i_b_a_i_o  wrapper
       does  not follow the usual C library conventions for indicating errors:
